{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Deferred\/batch(strategy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/deferred\/batch(strategy:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","text":"Batch","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP","text":"BatchStrategy","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"strategy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), every interval"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), on a signal or a unit of work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"), whenever any of several does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), or by a rule of your own ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"). After every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence never emits an empty array."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pending "},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends at once."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8DeferredV","role":"symbol","title":"batch(strategy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"BatchSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/BatchSequence.swift#L221"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Se